1d:["$","div",null,{"className":"cyber-glass p-5 md:p-7","children":[["$","h2","h2-0",{"className":"font-cyber text-lg text-cyber-blue mb-3 mt-5 border-b border-cyan-900/20 pb-2","children":"What Makes an AI \"Agentic\"?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim leading-relaxed mb-4","children":["A regular LLM call is stateless: you send a prompt, you get a response. An agent is different — it has a ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"className":"text-cyber-blue font-bold","children":"goal"}],", ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"className":"text-cyber-blue font-bold","children":"tools"}]," it can call, and a ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"className":"text-cyber-blue font-bold","children":"loop"}]," that runs until the goal is achieved or it runs out of steps."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"At micro1, I've been building AI agents that handle real-world workflows. The architecture has evolved significantly from \"just call GPT-4\" to production systems that are reliable, auditable, and efficient."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"className":"font-cyber text-lg text-cyber-blue mb-3 mt-5 border-b border-cyan-900/20 pb-2","children":"The Agent Loop"}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Every agent follows a basic loop:"}],"\n",["$","code","pre-0,code-0",{"className":"font-code text-xs bg-cyber-blue/10 text-cyber-blue px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded","children":"Observe → Think → Act → Observe → Think → Act → ... → Done\n"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"In LangGraph, this is modeled as a directed graph:"}],"\n",["$","div","pre-1,code-0",{"className":"my-4 cyber-glass p-4 rounded-lg overflow-x-auto","children":["$","code",null,{"className":"font-code text-xs text-cyber-green whitespace-pre","children":"from langgraph.graph import StateGraph, END\n\nworkflow = StateGraph(AgentState)\nworkflow.add_node(\"think\", reasoning_node)\nworkflow.add_node(\"act\", tool_execution_node)\nworkflow.add_node(\"observe\", result_processing_node)\n\nworkflow.add_conditional_edges(\n    \"think\",\n    should_continue,\n    {\"continue\": \"act\", \"done\": END}\n)\n"}]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-2",{"className":"font-cyber text-lg text-cyber-blue mb-3 mt-5 border-b border-cyan-900/20 pb-2","children":"Tool Design Matters More Than Model Choice"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"The most common mistake in agentic AI: spending too much time picking the LLM and too little time designing the tools."}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"A good agent tool has:"}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"className":"space-y-1 mb-4 ml-4 list-decimal","children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neon-pink mt-0.5","children":"▸"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"className":"text-cyber-blue font-bold","children":"A single, clear responsibility"}]," — tools that do too much lead to incorrect tool selection"]}]]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neon-pink mt-0.5","children":"▸"}],["$","span",null,{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"className":"text-cyber-blue font-bold","children":"Predictable input/output schemas"}]," — use Pydantic models, not loose dicts"]}]]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"className":"font-code text-sm text-cyber-blue-dim flex items-start gap-2","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-neon-pink mt-0.5","children":"▸"}],"$L22"]}],"\n","$L23","\n"]}],"\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35"]}]
